  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am Mia. I love animals. Today we color a silly picture. The picture has a cow and a crocodile. It has a cat, a bird, and a tree. The sun is in it too. A cow is black, white, or brown. A crocodile is green. It is not pink or purple. But today the colors are silly! Pink is my favorite color. Get your crayons.",
      "One, color the cow pink. Two, color the crocodile purple. Three, color the cat red. Four, color the bird blue. Five, color the tree orange. Six, color the sun green. Look at your picture! It is silly, but it is fun.",
      "Do you like your picture? Show it to a friend. Ask, \"Is a cow pink?\" Your friend says, \"No!\" Now color the page again. Color the cow brown. Color the crocodile green. Now they have the right colors. Which picture do you like?"
    ],
    "summary": "Mia gives steps to color a silly page with a pink cow and a purple crocodile. Real cows and crocodiles have other colors.",
